{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Les 9 pièces où les pères ne peuvent s'empêcher d'éteindre la lumière"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"“You don’t need the lights on when you’re asleep!”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"You can shower in the dark. I saw a documentary about it."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"“I might as well turn the fridge off, too, while I'm in here.”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"“You still watching TV, or can I turn that off, too?”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"“The only thing I’m eating right now is high electricity costs!”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"“The car doesn’t need to see anything, does it?”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"Business hours are daytime hours."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"“It’s never too early for babies to learn about fiscal responsibility.”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio8"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_8_hint","n":"ClueAudio8","s":"“What is this, Clue? Look, just turn the lights off.”"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"Because electricity isn’t free, kiddo!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio","s":"Great job! Are you done in here? I’m just going to turn off the lights."}]}
